\" data-t=\"(0,3)\"></span> ونصف قطرها <span class=m dir=ltr>13</span>"],["\\text{Arg}(z-4)=\\frac{\\pi}{4}:\\ y=x-4,\\ x>4","شعاع من <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(4,0)\"></span> بزاوية <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"45^\\circ\"></span>"],["x^2+(x-7)^2=169\\Rightarrow x^2-7x-60=0","بالتعويض"],["(x-12)(x+5)=0\\Rightarrow x=12","نرفض <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"x=-5\"></span> لأن <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"x&gt;4\"></span>"],["y=12-4=8",""]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"z=12+8i\"></span>","o":""}],[{"n":"19","s":[["|z-(3+2i)|=5:\\ (x-3)^2+(y-2)^2=25","دائرة مركزها <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(3,2)\"></span> ونصف قطرها <span class=m dir=ltr>5</span>"],["x^2+(y-6)^2=(x-7)^2+(y+1)^2\\Rightarrow y=x-1","المنصف العمودي للقطعة بين <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(0,6)\"></span> و <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(7,-1)\"></span>"],["(x-3)^2+(x-3)^2=25\\Rightarrow(x-3)^2=\\frac{25}{2}","بالتعويض <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"y-2=x-3\"></span>"],["x=3\\pm\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2},\\quad y=2\\pm\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2}",""]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"z=\\left(3+\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)+\\left(2+\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)i\\approx6.54+5.54i\"></span> ، <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"z=\\left(3-\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)+\\left(2-\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)i\\approx-0.54-1.54i\"></span>","o":""}],[{"n":"20","s":[["(1,6),\\ (4,1)","النقطتان في الشكل، والمستقيم منصفهما العمودي"],["\\text{midpoint}=(2.5,3.5),\\quad m=\\frac35","يمر بـ <span class=m dir=ltr>(0, 2)</span> ويوافق الشكل"],["|z-(4+i)|\\le|z-(1+6i)|","المنطقة المظللة في جهة النقطة <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(4,1)\"></span> والمستقيم متصل"]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"|z-4-i|\\le|z-1-6i|\"></span>","o":""},{"n":"21","s":[["\\text{center }3i,\\quad r=7-3=4","مركز الدائرة <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(0,3)\"></span> وتمر بـ <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(0,7)\"></span> و <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"(0,-1)\"></span>"],["|z-3i|<4","المنطقة داخل الدائرة والحد متقطع"]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"|z-3i|&lt;4\"></span>","o":""}],[{